    "description": "These glasses have a screen only you can see. 👓\n\nMeta Ray-Ban Display, which Meta is taking international after Connect 2026, has a small projector in the frame that sends a full-color image into the right lens. People around you see almost nothing. You control it with the Meta Neural Band, a wristband that reads the electrical signals from your wrist muscles, so a tiny pinch or swipe works like a click. Meta also teased hologram-style video calls.\n\nFinally, a legit excuse for staring at nothing. 👇\n\nSubscribe to Top Techs for more mind-blowing tech in under a minute.",
